#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/index.md:10
msgid "Optional component reference"
msgstr "可选组件参考"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/index.md:12
msgid ""
"Choose reusable protocol or coordination mechanisms by responsibility. "
"Components consume explicit ports and caller-owned storage; products own "
"scheduling, application policy and physical recovery. Exact-profile storage "
"headers belong only at static composition."
msgstr "按职责选择可复用协议或协调机制。组件使用显式端口及调用者拥有的存储；产品负责调度、应用策略和物理恢复。精确配置的存储头文件仅用于静态装配。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/index.md:14
msgid ""
"The API reference describes current software contracts. It does not "
"authorize an unselected MCU mode, Board connection, kernel gateway or "
"physical result."
msgstr "API 参考描述当前软件合同，不授予未选定的 MCU 模式、板级连接、内核网关或物理结果。"
